ial units that exemplify quality craftsmanship and design.  \n  \nThis development boasts top-line specifications and a comprehensive range of amenities tailored to elevate your living experience. From lush green landscapes to recreational spaces, the amenities at Shree Prathamesh Elite are curated to provide a lifestyle of relaxation and convenience. The interiors are meticulously planned to maximize space while reflecting contemporary aesthetics, making it an ideal choice for families and professionals alike.  \n  \nShree Prathamesh Elite is more than just a residential complex; it represents a lifestyle of unparalleled comfort and sophistication. Its strategic location in Kandivali West ensures excellent connectivity to key city areas, educational institutions, healthcare facilities, and entertainment hubs. Experience the perfect combination of luxury and convenience at Shree Prathamesh Elite, where every detail has been designed to enhance your way of living.\n\n## Floor Plans & Pricing of Shree Prathamesh Elite Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n![1 BHK Flat in Shree Prathamesh Elite in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 828814](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/125264/BHK_Configuration/1-470-1737805167.webp)\n\n1 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n470 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n1.03 Cr\n\n![2 BHK Flat in Shree Prathamesh Elite in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 828815](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/125264/BHK_Configuration/2-669-1737805183.webp)\n\n2 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n669 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n1.47 Cr\n\n![Floor Plan of Shree Prathamesh Elite in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 209293](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/125264/Floor%20Plan/FP-1737804356.webp)\n\nFloor Plan\n\n## Key Features of Shree Prathamesh Elite Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* Play Amenities.\n* Aesthetic Look.\n* Good Parking Space.\n* Modern Design.\n* Prime Location.\n* Spacious Apartment.\n\n## Amenities Shree Prathamesh Elite Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n--