 photos 9](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Sai Lee Prathamesh Elite photos 9\")\n![Sai Lee Prathamesh Elite photos 10](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Sai Lee Prathamesh Elite photos 10\")\n![Sai Lee Prathamesh Elite photos 11](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Sai Lee Prathamesh Elite photos 11\")\n![Sai Lee Prathamesh Elite photos 12](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Sai Lee Prathamesh Elite photos 12\")\n![Sai Lee Prathamesh Elite photos 13](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Sai Lee Prathamesh Elite photos 13\")\n![Sai Lee Prathamesh Elite photos 14](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Sai Lee Prathamesh Elite photos 14\")\n![Sai Lee Prathamesh Elite photos 15](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Sai Lee Prathamesh Elite photos 15\")\n![Sai Lee Prathamesh Elite photos 16](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Sai Lee Prathamesh Elite photos 16\")\n\n## About [Kandivali West](https://www.magicbricks.com/Kandivali-West-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\n![Kandivali West](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kandivali West\")\n\n## About Sai Lee Builders and Developers\n\n![Sai Lee Builders and Developers](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Sai Lee Builders and Developers\")\n\n|  |\n| --- |\n| M/s. Sailee Developers Pvt. Ltd., is a company owned by Mr. Mangesh Tukaram Sawant, who was born in small village namely 'Kankavali in the District of Sindhudurg, State – Maharashtra. Thereafter he came to Mumbai and started constructing roads in the year 1982 and further he started construction of buildings in the year 1990. In the year 1995, he endeavours with an approach of making his Sailee Developers Pvt. Ltd., into the list of top most construction companies.    For over twenty three years, Sailee Developers Pvt. Ltd., has added to its portfolio a string of residential, commercial projects that range from budget homes and future-ready apartments to elegant office spaces and plush retail hubs. Every space we have built is a celebration of life. Today, our legacy of crafting unique spaces, our strong business ethics and unwavering commitment to quality, sets us apart in the real estate industry. It has been our privilege to create homes that feel like home to more than 4,000 happy families. And we look forward to creating more for the families in future.    Now the he is known as a renowned builder and a strong visionary. At very young age he has developed his expansion. He always believes in uplifting below poverty line communities for which he started his own Charity Trust by name Smt. Lilavati Sawant Charitable Trust. He has also constructed many schools and hospitals and has constructed free houses for poor people under which many social service activities take place like distributing books, granting scholarships to deserving students, free medical health check-up and blood donation camps, etc.    He proved his spirituality by constructing Lord Rameshwar Mandir in his hometown, Kankavali. To ensure security of his surroundings people, he constructed and donated a Police Station in Borivali, Mumbai.    To import quality education in children he started state Board & International schools in different parts of Mumbai and Kankavali. All of them are running successfully since so many years.    His values to hold a high level of passion, reverence and commitment to both humans and the nature which is a proof of his top-notch Constrcution ornamented with exquisite designs and extraordinarily smart innovations |\n\n![Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner\")\n![](data:image/svg+xml;base64,)\n![Pebble La Serena Tower 5 Tower 6 and Tower 7 photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Pebble La Serena Tower 5 Tower 6 and Tower 7 photo\")\n![Rock Highland photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Rock Highland photo\")\n![Gagangiri Aadhya photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Gagangiri Aadhya photo\")\n![Shraddha Gold Crest photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Shraddha Gold Crest photo\")\n![DPS Nakshatra Heights photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"DPS Nakshatra Heights photo\")\n![Kush Elegante photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kush Elegante photo\")\n![Siddha Seabrook photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Siddha Seabrook photo\")\n![Ruparel Sky Greens photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ruparel Sky Greens photo\")\n![Ruparel WestSky photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ruparel WestSky photo\")\n![Bhoomi Sagar Manthan photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Bhoomi Sagar Manthan photo\")\n\n## Other Projects by Sai Lee Builders and Developers\n\n![Sai Lee Heritage photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Sai Lee Heritage photo\")\n\n## FAQs about Sai Lee Prathamesh Elite\n\n### What is the total area of Sai Lee Prathamesh Elite?\n\n### What is the RERA number of Sai Lee Prathamesh Elite?\n\n### What are other residential projects near Sai Lee Prathamesh Elite?\n\n### What is the address of Sai Lee Prathamesh Elite?\n\n### Which is nearest metro station to Sai Lee Prathamesh Elite?\n\n### Where can I download the brochure PDF of Sai Lee Prathamesh Elite from?\n\n### How many units are in Sai Lee Prathamesh Elite?\n\n### What is the area pin code of Sai Lee Prathamesh Elite?\n\n### Which is nearest bus stop to Sai Lee Prathamesh Elite?\n\n### How many towers in Sai Lee Prathamesh Elite?\n\n![Mumbai Metro Line 3 Route Map, Stations, & Opening Status | Aqua Line Metro Mumbai](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Mumbai Metro Line 3 Route Map, Stations, & Opening Status | Aqua Line Metro Mumbai\")\n![Mumbai Metro 2026: Route, Map, Stations List, Lines, News](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Mumbai Metro 2026: Route, Map, Stations List, Lines, News\")\n![Salman Khan House in Galaxy Apartments Bandra - Mumbai](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Salman Khan House in Galaxy Apartments Bandra - Mumbai\")\n![Harbour Line Mumbai Stations - Route, Map, Timings, Fare & More](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Harbour Line Mumbai Stations - Route, Map, Timings, Fare & More\")\n![Central Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Station, Timings, Fare & More](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ce