esh Elite by Shree Sainath Developers offers 1BHK and 2BHK apartments designed to provide modern, comfortable, and secure family living.\n\n### **Project Details:**\n\n* Shree Prathamesh Elite is spread across 1.09 acres with a single G+23 residential tower.\n* The project offers well-designed 1BHK and 2BHK homes planned for natural light and efficient space usage.\n* Amenities include gymnasium, kids play area, yoga zone, jogging track, swimming pool, and indoor games.\n* Essential facilities such as power backup, 24×7 water, gas pipeline, waste disposal, rainwater harvesting, and gated security are provided.\n* Located off New Link Road, the project enjoys excellent connectivity to Western Express Highway, Kandivali Railway Station, and key lifestyle conveniences.\n\n### **Carpet Area:**\n\nShree Prathamesh Elite carpet area details are given below:\n\n* 1BHK – 227.01 sq.ft. to 266.3 sq.ft.\n* 2BHK – 340.89 sq.ft. to 402.46 sq.ft.\n\n### **Lifestyle Amenities:**\n\n* Swimming Pool\n* Gym\n* Indoor Games\n* Kids Play Area\n* Yoga Zone\n* Jogging Track\n\n### **Facilities:**\n\n* Lift\n* Gas Pipeline\n* Power Back Up\n* Parking\n* Security System\n* Washroom\n* Natural Light\n* 24×7 Water\n* Waste Disposal\n* No Open Drainage\n* RWH\n* Gated Society\n\n### **Why to Invest in this Property?**\n\n* Prime Kandivali West location with excellent livability.\n* Upgraded lifestyle with full modern amenities.\n* Secure gated society with essential daily facilities.\n* Quick access to major transport routes and social infrastructure.\n* Strong long-term appreciation potential.\n\n### **Possession & RERA:**\n\nExpected possession: December 2026  \n MahaRERA registration number: P51800029737.\n\n[Read More](javascript:void(0);) [Read Less](javascript:void(0);)\n\n---\n\n### Download Brochure\n\nReceive a digital copy of   \nShree Prathamesh Elite brochure\n\n## Pricing of Shree Prathamesh Elite\n\n### Pricing & Unit Plans\n\n* [1 BHK Apartment](#tabs-3)\n* [2 BHK Apartment](#tabs-5)\n\n* [227.01 sqft](#tabs-13977)\n* [266.3 sqft](#tabs-13978)\n\n![1 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n1 BHK | Carpet Area: 227.01 sqft | Price:\n\n![1 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n1 BHK | Carpet Area: 266.3 sqft | Price:\n\n* [340.89 sqft](#tabs-13979)\n* [376.41 sqft](#tabs-13980)\n* [402.46 sqft](#tabs-13981)\n\n![2 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n2 BHK | Carpet Area: 340.89 sqft | Price:\n\n![2 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n2 BHK | Carpet Area: 376.41 sqft | Price:\n\n![2 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n2 BHK | Carpet Area: 402.46 sqft | Price:\n\n## Property Features of Shree Prathamesh Elite\n\n### Amenities\n\n* ![Club house](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/XHmlGOsa5pmWAop1jsrzbhwfyh0ZziFBsDDydKHm.webp) Club house\n\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/caC1nd4EG3aPxrSHSy42KOuI69993uXqnhmO5wM1.webp) Kids Play Area\n\n* ![Swimming Pool](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/SFZjCUNkC7Mx0X3VU5OrVgx4mtJUvqfykBy0PZer.webp) Swimming Pool\n\n* ![Gym](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/IGXHlscIm9ZRf5Dwqaa7fOuHpxoQXC8VN6qHvSos.webp) Gym\n\n---\n\n### Facilities\n\n* ![Lift](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/PlsX6Ye4mz30wZTyU2HUzRfZZAF1UyAfAPcv7UW6.webp) Lift\n\n* ![Gas Pipeline](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/77fRi35ugy3nBpLGvEFZIc9Nzx43eeLJEWJkzUuI.webp) Gas Pipeline\n\n* ![Power Back Up](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/hyhD5ZsEryAKGW3ZBDuJfwfIbR00KY59KGRA3TdM.webp) Power Back Up\n\n* ![Parking](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/Mn1Br3z95nMIVacp1Oa7MFHiuII6ZjpgFaetLKCL