ivali West**\n\n* Atharva Institute of Management Studies\n* Dumpty Humpty Pre School & Activity Centre\n* New Blossoms Montessori Preschool & Daycare in Borivali\n* Ryan International School, Kandivali East, Mumbai - CBSE\n* Swami Vivekanand International School\n* Thakur Specialized Degree College\n* Niranjana Majithia College of Commerce\n\n**Hospitals in Kandivali West**\n\n* Thunga Hospital\n* ACE Heart Hospital\n* CritiCare Asia Multispeciality Hospital\n* Cloudnine Hospital - Malad | Best Maternity & Pregnancy Centre\n\n**Shopping and Entertainment in Kandivali West**\n\n* Infiniti Mall - Malad West\n* Growel's 101 Mall\n* Inorbit Mall Malad\n* D Mart\n\n## About Shree Sainath Developers\n\n![Shree Sainath Developers](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/developer/d9uMFdefeRY1HwMTuDXn6yF75uVDB9UclukYH8h3.webp)\n\n* Year Estd. 2010\n* [Projects - 1](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/shree-sainath-developers-projects-in-mumbai)\n\n#### Shree Sainath Developers\n\nShree Sainath Developers\n\n## QR Codes of Shree Prathamesh Elite\n\n![P51800029737.webp](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/PMFWEmk4Hmdv3vysnRw97RvaVKDwvwGz7pBZMJAW.webp) P51800029737\n\n## EMI Calculator\n\n₹1,00,00,000 ₹2,00,00,000 ₹3,00,00,000\n\n###### Monthly EMI: ₹0.00\n\n## FAQ's of Shree Prathamesh Elite\n\nWhat is the address of Shree Prathamesh Elite?\n\nThe Shree Prathamesh Elite is located at Mathuradas Road, off New Link Road, Kandivali, Hemu Colony, Bhagat Colony, Kandivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra.  [Book Site Visit Here](#myModal)\n\nWhat is Rera Number of Shree Prathamesh Elite?\n\nShree Prathamesh Elite Kandivali West RERA number is P51800029737.\n\nWhat configurations are available at Shree Prathamesh Elite Kandivali West?\n\nShree Prathamesh Elite offers premium 1,2 BHK Apartment flats for sale in Kandivali West.\n\nWhat is the starting price of a flat at Shree Prathamesh Elite Kandivali West?\n\nShree Prathamesh Elite flat price in Kandivali West starts at ₹ Onwards.\n\n...\n\nHow many floors are there in the Shree Prathamesh Elite Kandivali West project?\n\nThe Shree Prathamesh Elite Kandivali West project boasts 23 storeys offering well-planned layouts and modern amenities.\n\nWhat is the Possession Date of Shree Prathamesh Elite Kandivali West?\n\nThe project is Under Construction   \n The Shree Prathamesh Elite Kandivali West RERA possession is scheduled for December 2026.\n\nWhy choose the Shree Prathamesh Elite residential project in Kandivali West?\n\nShree Prathamesh Elite is one of the best  [residential projects in Kandivali West](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/residential-property-for-sale-in-kandivali-west-mumbai) for both investment and living purposes. Get access to the best of schools, hospitals, and entertainment hubs.  [Express your interest today](#myModal)\n\nFrom where to get the floor plan of Shree Prathamesh Elite Kandivali West?\n\nThe Shree Prathamesh Elite Kandivali West floor plan is designed for optimum use and plenty of natural light. The layouts are designed as per Vastu principles.  [Check out the floor plan here.](#myModal)\n\nFrom where to get the price sheet of Shree Prathamesh Elite Kandivali West?\n\nThe Shree Prathamesh Elite Kandivali West price sheet is important for clarity on the price breakdown and other payment details of the flat.  [Check price sheet](#myModal)\n\nWhat are the stamp duty and registration charges in Kandivali West’s Shree Prathamesh Elite project?\n\nThe stamp duty and registration charges in Kandivali West for Shree Prathamesh Elite may vary depending on current government regulations. For the latest update connect with our sales team. [Call Now](tel:7045670457)\n\nWhat kind of amenities are available at Shree Prathamesh Elite Kandivali West?\n\nThe Shree Prathamesh Elite project in Kandivali West offers a wide range of lifestyle amenities, including a swimming pool, jogging track, gym, kids play area, multipurpose lawn, garden, senior citizen zone, and more.\n\nHow is the connectivity near Shree Prathamesh Elite Kandivali West?\n\nStrategically located on in Kandivali West, Shree Prathamesh Elite enjoys exceptional connectivity via roads, highways, and railways. The upcoming infrastructure makes it easier for daily travelers.\n\n## More Projects near Kandivali West\n\n[![Sayba Aramya](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/csp.webp)\n\nRead more](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/sayba-aramya-project-kandivali-west-mumbai/8870) \n\n### [Sayba Aramya](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/sayba-aramya-project-kandivali-west-mumbai/8870)\n\n##### by Sayba Group\n\n1,2,3 BHK Apartment  \n Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n₹ 1.11 Cr - 2.59 Cr\n\n[![PCPL Rajesh Mandir](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/csp.webp)\n\nRead more](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/pcpl-rajesh-mandir-project-kandivali-west-mumbai/8823) \n\n### [PCPL Rajesh Mandir](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/pcpl-rajesh-mandir-project-kandivali-west-mumbai/8823)\n\n##### by PCPL\n\n1,2 BHK Apartment  \n Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n₹ 1.49 Cr - 2.11 Cr\n\n[![Paradigm kandivali West Mahavir nagar](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/csp.webp)\n\nRead more](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/paradigm-kandivali-west-mahavir-nagar-project-kandivali-west-mumbai/8819) \n\n### [Paradigm kandivali West Mahavir nagar](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/paradigm-kandivali-west-mahavir-nagar-project-kandivali-west-mumbai/8819)\n\n##### by Paradigm Realty\n\n1 BHK Apartment  \n Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n₹ 90.00 Lac - 1.95 Cr\n\n[![Godrej Mahavir nagar](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/csp.webp)\n\nRead more](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/godrej-mahavir-nagar-project-kandivali-west-mumbai/8813) \n\n### [Godrej Mahavir nagar](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/godrej-mahavir-nagar-pro