sources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/prathamesh-elite_1770726651888-285992666-1280w.webp)\n\n# Prathamesh Elite Kandivali West\n\n[By Sailee Developers](/builder/sailee-developers)|\n\nHemu Colony, [Kandivali West](/in/mumbai/kandivali-west)\n\n₹1.22 Cr - 2.06 Cr All inc.\n\n![Prathamesh Elite Kandivali West - main project image](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/prathamesh-elite_1770726643714-698312397-1280w.webp)\n\n![Prathamesh Elite Kandivali West - image 2](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/prathamesh-elite_1770726565491-617087884-1280w.webp)\n\n![Prathamesh Elite Kandivali West - image 3](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/prathamesh-elite_1770726567273-195220286-1280w.webp)\n\n![Prathamesh Elite Kandivali West - image 4](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/prathamesh-elite_1770726568941-653076416-1280w.webp)\n\n![Prathamesh Elite Kandivali West - image 5](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/prathamesh-elite_1770726579755-689446348-1280w.webp)\n\n8+ more\n\nWatch This Project Reel\n\nSee highlights of Prathamesh Elite\n\n[View Full Reel](/reels)\n\nExplore More Reelsin Kandivali West\n\nWatch reels of other projects in the same locality\n\n[Watch All Reels](/reels)\n\nWatch This Project Reel\n\nSee highlights of Prathamesh Elite\n\n[View Full Reel](/reels)\n\nExplore More Reelsin Kandivali West\n\nWatch reels of other projects in the same locality\n\n[Watch All Reels](/reels)\n\n## Prathamesh Elite Overview\n\n![Land Parcel](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fland-parcel-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1.09 acres\n\nLand Parcel\n\n![Towers](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fnumber-of-towers-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1\n\nTowers\n\n![Floors](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fnumber-of-floors-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nG+1C+22\n\nFloors\n\n![Config](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fconfig-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1, 2, 3 BHK\n\nConfig\n\n![Carpet Area](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fcarpet-area-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n464-822 sqft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![RERA NO.](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2FRERA-number-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nP51800029737\n\nRERA NO.\n\n![Possession Status](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpossession-status-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nAdvance Stage (<1 yr)\n\nPossession Status\n\n![Target Possession](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Ftarget-possession-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nDec 2026\n\nTarget Possession\n\n![RERA Possession](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2FRERA-possession-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nDec 2027\n\nRERA Possession\n\n![Litigation](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flitigation-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nNo\n\nLitigation\n\n### About Prathamesh Elite\n\nSailee Kandivali West Project Overview  \nPrathamesh Elite Project will be constructed on 1.09 acres of land parcel, 1 tower with G+1C+22 floors having 1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK premium residences.  \n  \nPrathamesh Elite location  \nProject is located Off New Link Rd, Hemu Colony, Kandivali West, Mumbai with -  \nDahanukarwadi Metro Station - 400m  \nKandivali Railway Station - 1.6km  \nDMart - 1.7km  \n  \nPrathamesh Elite Kandivali West Project Amenities  \nFirst is Internal amenities -  \nVitrified Tiles, Granite Platform, Stainless Steel Sink, Equivalent CP Fitting, Anti-Skid Flooring,  \n  \nSailee Developers Kandivali West External Amenities  \nProject has 15+ luxurious amenities with likes of -  \nGymnasium  \nSwimming Pool  \nKids Play Area  \nWalking Area & Many More  \n  \nSailee Developers Prathamesh Elite Kandivali West Parking -  \nProject has one type of car parking facility -  \n1) Tower Parking  \n  \nPrathamesh Elite Possession -  \nRera Possession - December 2027  \nTarget Possession - September 2027  \n  \nCarpet Area & Floor Plan  \nPrathamesh Elite project has 1BHK, 2BHK, 3BHK premium residences with -  \n1BHK - (464 to 470) sqft  \n2BHK - (669 to 670) sqft  \n3BHK - 822 sqft  \n  \nPrathamesh Elite floor plan  \nTower floor plan will have 3 flats, 2 lifts & 1 staircase on each floor  \n  \nPrathamesh Elite Mumbai Prices & its details can be found in the price section & Prathamesh Elite Kandivali West brochure can be downloaded from the link mentionedd below. Project has been praised by the home buyers & Sailee Developers Kandivali West review is 4 out of 5 from over all the clients who have visited the site.\n\n## Prathamesh Elite Location\n\nOff New Link Rd, Hemu Colony, Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n* Dahanukarwadi Metro Station - 400m\n* Kandivali Railway Station - 1.6km\n* D Mart - 1.7km\n\n![360 background](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2F360-background-image.webp&w=1280&q=75)\n\n![Housiey Logo](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Flogo1.png&w=256&q=75)\n\n![360](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2F360-tour-icon.png&w=128&q=75)\n\n## Prathamesh Elite Videos\n\n## Prathamesh Elite Pros & Cons\n\n![Pros-icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fthumbs-up-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nPros\n\n![toggle-arrow](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Farrow-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1.The project is located at a prime spot near Boraspada Road, offering excellent connectivity to the metro, railway station, malls, and other key destinations.\n\n2.The project offers large carpet areas, especially in its 1 BHK units—something very rare in today’s market, where most builders focus on compact layouts. If you prefer spacious homes, this project is perfect for you.\n\n![Cons-icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fthumbs-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nCons\n\n![toggle-arrow](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Farrow-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1.The project has relatively small carpet areas, especially for the 3 BHK units, so if you’re looking for a spacious apartment, this may not be the ideal choice for you.\n\n## Prathamesh Elite Amenities\n\n### Internal Amenities\n\n![Vitrified Tiles](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652438961711-img.webp)\n\nVitrified Tiles\n\n![Granite Kitchen Platform](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/granite-kitchen-platform_External_1770712604025-330259421.webp)\n\nGranite Kitchen Platform\n\n![Stainless Steel Sink](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1646987626444-img.webp)\n\nStainless Steel Sink\n\n### External Amenities\n\n![Swimming Pool](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652447054692-img.webp)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![Kids Play Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446278292-img.webp)\n\nKids Play Area\n\n![Senior Citizen Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446899508-img.webp)\n\nSenior Citizen Area\n\n![Roof Top Sky Garden](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/roof-top-sky-garden_External_1770725118038-271107108.webp)\n\nRoof Top Sky Garden\n\n![Seating Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/seating-area_External_1770882751990-34368358.webp)\n\nSeating Area\n\n![Gymnasium](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/gymnasium_External_1770730220696-33756910.webp)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![Walking Track](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/walking-track_External_1770892185967-695726456.webp)\n\nWalking Track\n\n## Prathamesh Elite Master & Floor Plan\n\n### Master Plan\n\n![Prathamesh Elite Master Plan](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/prathamesh-elite_1770726655960-869996810-1280w.webp)\n\n### Floor Plan\n\n![Prathamesh Elite Floor Plan](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/prathamesh-elite_1770726659810-878188546-1280w.webp)\n\n## Prathamesh Elite Pricing & Unit Plans\n\n| Carpet Area | All Inc. Price  (Inc. of Taxes & Charges) | Min Downpayment  (Inc. Taxes) | Parking | Unit Plan |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 464 sqft | 1.22 Cr All In |