)\n\n2 CitiesLocations\n\nMumbai CityMumbai suburban\n\n30 yearsExperience\n\n12Total Projects\n\n100+Happy Families\n\nM/s. Sailee Developers Pvt. Ltd., is a company owned by Mr. Mangesh Tukaram Sawant, who was born in small village namely 'Kankavali in the District of Sindhudurg, State – Maharashtra. Thereafter he came to Mumbai and started constructing roads in the year 1982 and further he started construction of buildings in the year 1990. In the year 1995, he endeavours with an approach of making his Sailee Developers Pvt. Ltd., into the list of top most construction companies.\n\n## Frequently Asked Question\n\nThe sample flat is not ready yet. However, Housiey provides detailed floor plans, 3D walkthroughs, and virtual consultations with a property expert. Our team can explain the layout, unit sizes, and project details in detail.\n\nThe expected possession date is **01 December 2027** as per RERA. Construction is currently **70%** complete as of August 6, 2026. Target possession is **01 December 2026**.\n\nYes, it is RERA registered. The RERA number is **P51800029737**.  \nYou can verify it on the official RERA portal: <https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/33994>\n\nNo, it has no pending litigation. All legal documents including the Commencement Certificate and Legal Title Report are available on Housiey for review before booking.\n\nThe following legal documents are available on Housiey: **Commencement Certificate**, **Legal Title Report**, **Layout Plan**, **Proforma Allotment Letter**. You can preview them directly on the project page or verify them independently on the official RERA portal using RERA number **P51800029737**.\n\nThis project offers **10+** amenities. Key external amenities include Walking Track, Gymnasium, Seating Area, Roof Top Sky Garden, and Senior Citizen Area.  \n Internal specifications include Stainless Steel Sink and Granite Kitchen Platform. The complete amenities list is available on Housiey.\n\nMonthly maintenance details are available in the price sheet. You can download it from the project page on Housiey.\n\nIn Prathamesh Elite, the 1BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **464 sq. ft.**  \n• **470 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nIn Prathamesh Elite, the 2BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **669 sq. ft.**  \n• **670 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nIn Prathamesh Elite, the 3BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **822 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 1BHK in Prathamesh Elite starts from **₹1.22 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **464 sq. ft.** – ₹1.22 Cr (all-inclusive)  \n• **470 sq. ft.** – ₹1.22 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 2BHK in Prathamesh Elite starts from **₹1.70 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **669 sq. ft.** – ₹1.70 Cr (all-inclusive)  \n• **670 sq. ft.** – ₹1.70 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 3BHK in Prathamesh Elite starts from **₹2.06 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **822 sq. ft.** – ₹2.06 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nIt is built across **1.09 acres** with **1** towers with **G+1C+22** floors. Each floor has **3** flats per floor, **2** lifts, **1** staircases. It is available in **1BHK/2BHK/3BHK** configurations with carpet areas ranging from **464** to **822 sq. ft.**\n\nPrathamesh Elite provides dedicated car parking facilities for residents. The exact parking type and the number of spaces allotted per unit are mentioned in the Unit Plan, which you can download for free on the Prathamesh Elite project page on Housiey.\n\nIt is located at **Off New Link Rd, Hemu Colony, Kandivali West, Mumbai**.  \nNearby landmarks include:  \n**• Dahanukarwadi Metro Station - 400m**   \n**• Kandivali Railway Station - 1.6km**   \n**• D Mart - 1.7km**\n\nThe following payment plans are available:  \n• **CLP ( Construction Link plan)** - Regular Standard Slabwise Payment as per construction, Maximum loan possible up to 90%  \n  \n**Note:** In some cases, payment plan deviations can be considered based on your preferred terms. The final schedule is confirmed after your site visit.\n\nThe minimum down payment starts from **₹18.00 Lacs**, inclusive of all taxes. EMI options are also available. Use the EMI calculator on the project page to check monthly instalments based on your loan amount and tenure.\n\nYes, it is approved by leading banks including **Central Bank of India**, **Union Bank of India**, **Bank Of India**, **Bank Of Baroda**, **Citi Bank**, **Kotak Mahindra Bank**, **Axis Bank**, **State Bank Of India**, **ICICI Bank**, **HDFC BANK**. The complete approved bank list is available in the Banks section on Housiey. Home loan eligibility depends on the bank's lending policy and your 